</style></head>
<body>
<header><h1>✦ Firefly 管理后台</h1><div style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center"><a href="/" style="color:#16864f;font-size:13px">返回网站 ↗</a><button class="btn" id="logout" type="button">退出登录</button></div></header>
<nav class="admin-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="后台管理模块">
  <button id="tabArticles" class="admin-tab" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="articlesTabPanel">📝 文章管理</button>
  <button id="tabAppearance" class="admin-tab" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="appearanceTabPanel" tabindex="-1">🎨 全局外观配置</button>
  <button id="tabAiProviders" class="admin-tab" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="aiProvidersTabPanel" tabindex="-1">🤖 AI 服务管理</button>
</nav>
<main class="wrap">
<div id="articlesTabPanel" class="articles-grid" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tabArticles">
<section
  class="min-w-0 rounded-xl border border-gray-200/80 bg-white p-4 shadow-sm"
>
  <div class="mb-4 flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
    <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-800">文章管理</h2>
    <button
      id="refresh"
      type="button"
      class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white px-3 py-2 text-sm text-gray-600 transition hover:border-emerald-200 hover:bg-emerald-50/50 hover:text-emerald-700 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-500/30"
    >
      刷新
    </button>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-3 space-y-2">
    <input
      id="search"
      type="search"
      placeholder="搜索文章标题或路径…"
      aria-label="搜索文章"
      class="w-full rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-gray-800 placeholder:text-gray-400 transition hover:border-gray-300 focus:border-emerald-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-500/20"
    />
    <select
      id="statusFilter"
      aria-label="筛选文章状态"
      class="w-full rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-gray-700 transition hover:border-gray-300 focus:border-emerald-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-500/20"
    >
      <option value="all">全部文章</option>
      <option value="published">已发布</option>
      <option value="draft">草稿箱</option>
      <option value="scheduled">定时发布</option>
    </select>
  </div>

  <button
    id="new"
    type="button"
    class="mb-4 flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-emerald-600 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-white shadow-sm transition hover:bg-emerald-700 hover:shadow active:scale-[0.99] focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-500/40 focus:ring-offset-2"
  >
    <span aria-hidden="true" class="text-base leading-none">+</span>
    新建文章
  </button>

  <div
    id="list"
    class="max-h-[60vh] space-y-1 overflow-y-auto pr-1"
    aria-label="文章列表"
  >
    <p class="rounded-lg px-3 py-8 text-center text-sm text-gray-400">
      正在读取文章列表…
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="min-w-0 rounded-xl border border-gray-200/80 bg-white p-4 shadow-sm"><h2 id="formTitle" style="font-size:16px;margin:0 0 16px">新建文章</h2>
<details id="aiWriterPanel" class="mb-4 rounded-xl border border-emerald-200 bg-emerald-50/50 p-4">
  <summary class="cursor-pointer list-inside font-semibold text-emerald-900">✨ AI 自然语言写作助手</summary>
  <div class="mt-3 space-y-3">
    <p class="text-sm leading-6 text-gray-600">用中文描述你想写的文章，或说明希望怎样修改当前正文。AI 只生成待审核内容，不会自动保存或发布；确认后仍使用下方现有的预览、保存和发布流程。</p>
    <div class="field">
      <label for="aiPrompt">写作要求 / 修改指令</label>
      <textarea id="aiPrompt" rows="4" maxlength="8000" class="w-full rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-gray-800 focus:border-emerald-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-500/20" placeholder="例如：写一篇面向零基础学生的 Python 列表入门文章，包含生活化例子、常见错误和练习题。"></textarea>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
      <button type="button" id="aiGenerate" class="btn primary">生成新文章草稿</button>
      <button type="button" id="aiRewrite" class="btn">按指令修改当前文章</button>
    </div>
    <p class="muted">生成新文章时，若当前表单已有未保存内容，应用结果前会请你确认。修改现有文章时，只替换正文并保留标题、文件名和其他文章信息；若 AI 改动代码块、公式、图片、链接或特殊组件，系统会阻止应用以保护原文。</p>
    <p id="aiStatus" class="status" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></p>
    <section id="aiResult" class="rounded-lg border border-emerald-200 bg-white p-3" hidden>
      <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-800">待审核的 AI 草稿</h3>
      <p id="aiResultTitle" class="mt-2 font-medium text-gray-900"></p>
      <p id="aiResultMeta" class="mt-1 text-xs text-gray-500"></p>
      <pre id="aiResultBody" class="mt-3 max-h-64 overflow-auto whitespace-pre-wrap break-words rounded-lg bg-gray-50 p-3 text-xs leading-6 text-gray-700"></pre>
      <div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
        <button type="button" id="aiApply" class="btn primary">填入编辑器并预览</button>
        <button type="button" id="aiDiscard" class="btn">放弃这份草稿</button>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</details>
<form id="editor">
<div class="field"><label for="title">标题 *</label><input id="title" required maxlength="200"></div>
<div class="grid"><div class="field"><label for="slug">文件名 *</label><input id="slug" required placeholder="my-post"></div><div class="field"><label for="published">展示发布日期 *</label><input id="published" type="date" required></div></div>
<div class="grid"><div class="field"><label for="date">定时发布时间（北京时间）</label><input id="date" type="datetime-local" step="60"><small class="muted">留空表示立即生效；填写未来时间后，系统会自动安排重建。</small></div><div class="field"><label for="articlePassword">访问密码（可选）</label><input id="articlePassword" type="password" maxlength="200" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="留空则不启用密码保护"><small class="muted">输入后，前台将显示密码解锁页面。</small></div></div>
<div class="field"><label for="passwordHint">密码提示（可选）</label><input id="passwordHint" maxlength="120" placeholder="例如：课程名称"></div>
<p class="muted" style="color:#b42318">安全提醒：当前 GitHub 仓库是公开的，Markdown 原文和 password 字段都可能被直接读取。现有密码保护只加密构建后的网页，不能保护公开仓库中的原文和密码；不要在此保存真正机密的内容。</p>
<div class="grid"><div class="field"><label for="category">分类</label><input id="category" maxlength="100"></div><div class="field"><label for="tags">标签（逗号分隔）</label><input id="tags" placeholder="技术, 随笔"></div></div>
<div class="field"><label for="description">摘要</label><input id="description" maxlength="500"></div>
<div class="field">
<label for="body">文章正文</label>
<div class="local-recovery-row">
  <label class="local-recovery-toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="localRecoveryCheck"> <span>启用本地恢复</span></label>
  <button type="button" id="restoreLocalRecovery" class="btn" hidden disabled>恢复未保存内容</button>
  <span id="localRecoveryStatus" class="muted" role="status" aria-live="polite">默认关闭。开启后仅在当前浏览器标签页保存未加密文章的恢复副本。</span>
</div>
<div class="editor-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="文章编辑模式">
<button class="btn active" type="button" id="visualTab" role="tab" aria-selected="true" disabled>可视化编辑器加载中…</button>
<button class="btn" type="button" id="editorTab" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Markdown 源码</button>
<button class="btn" type="button" id="previewTab" role="tab" aria-selected="false">预览</button>
</div>
<div class="editor-reading-controls" id="editorReadingControls" aria-label="阅读字号设置">
  <span class="editor-reading-controls__label">阅读字号</span>
  <button type="button" id="editorReadingSmaller" aria-label="缩小阅读字号" title="缩小字号">A−</button>
  <output id="editorReadingSizeValue" aria-live="polite">16 px</output>
  <button type="button" id="editorReadingLarger" aria-label="放大阅读字号" title="放大字号">A+</button>
  <button type="button" id="editorReadingReset" title="恢复默认字号">默认</button>
  <span class="editor-reading-controls__hint">只影响当前标签页的显示，不会修改文章内容</span>
</div>
<div id="wysiwygPane" class="rich-editor-shell">
  <div class="rich-editor-toolbar" role="toolbar" aria-label="文章格式工具栏">
    <button type="button" data-editor-action="paragraph" title="普通正文">正文</button>
    <button type="button" data-editor-action="h1" title="一级标题">H1</button>
    <button type="button" data-editor-action="h2" title="二级标题">H2</button>
    <button type="button" data-editor-action="h3" title="三级标题">H3</button>
    <span class="toolbar-divider" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <button type="button" data-editor-action="bold" title="加粗"><strong>加粗</strong></button>
    <button type="button" data-editor-action="italic" title="斜体"><em>斜体</em></button>
    <button type="button" data-editor-action="underline" title="下划线"><u>下划线</u></button>
    <button type="button" data-editor-action="strike" title="删除线"><s>删除线</s></button>
    <span class="toolbar-divider" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <button type="button" data-editor-action="bullet" title="无序列表">• 列表</button>
    <button type="button" data-editor-action="ordered" title="有序列表">1. 列表</button>
    <button type="button" data-editor-action="quote" title="引用">引用</button>
    <button type="button" data-editor-action="badge" title="插入可直接编辑的徽章组件">徽章</button>
    <button type="button" data-editor-action="callout" title="插入可编辑提示卡片">提示卡片</button>
    <button type="button" data-editor-action="code" title="代码块">代码</button>
    <button type="button" data-editor-action="rule" title="分割线">分割线</button>
    <span class="toolbar-divider" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <button type="button" data-editor-action="link" title="插入或编辑链接">链接</button>
    <button type="button" data-editor-action="unlink" title="移除链接">取消链接</button>
    <button type="button" id="wysiwygUpload" title="上传图片">图片</button>
    <input type="file" id="wysiwygFile" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp,image/gif" hidden>
    <button type="button" data-editor-action="table" title="选择行数、列数和表头后插入表格">插入表格</button>
    <div id="tableEditorTools" class="table-editor-tools" role="group" aria-label="表格编辑工具" hidden>
      <span class="toolbar-divider" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <button type="button" data-editor-action="addRowBefore" title="在当前行上方插入一行">上方加行</button>
      <button type="button" data-editor-action="addRowAfter" title="在当前行下方插入一行">下方加行</button>
      <button type="button" data-editor-action="addColumnBefore" title="在当前列左侧插入一列">左侧加列</button>
      <button type="button" data-editor-action="addColumnAfter" title="在当前列右侧插入一列">右侧加列</button>
      <button type="button" data-editor-action="toggleHeaderRow" title="将第一行切换为表头或普通行">切换表头</button>
      <button type="button" data-editor-action="deleteRow" title="删除当前所在行">删除当前行</button>
      <button type="button" data-editor-action="deleteColumn" title="删除当前所在列">删除当前列</button>
      <button type="button" data-editor-action="deleteTable" title="删除整张表格">删除表格</button>
    </div>
    <span class="toolbar-divider" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <button type="button" data-editor-action="undo" title="撤销">撤销</button>
    <button type="button" data-editor-action="redo" title="重做">重做</button>
  </div>
  <div id="wysiwygNotice" class="rich-editor-notice" hidden></div>
  <div id="wysiwygEditor" class="rich-editor-canvas"></div>
  <div class="rich-editor-help">直接输入中文并按回车分段。选中文字后使用工具栏格式化；支持图片粘贴/拖入；点击图片可放大预览，键盘聚焦后按 Enter 或空格也可预览。还支持链接、列表、引用、代码块和表格。包含无法无损转换的 MDX/HTML 特殊语法时，会自动切换回源码模式保护原文。</div>
</div>
<div id="wysiwygFallback" hidden>可视化编辑器加载失败，正文将保持原样。你仍可在 Markdown 源码模式下继续编辑。</div>
<textarea id="body" spellcheck="false" hidden placeholder="在此编辑 Markdown / MDX 源文件。含特殊组件的文章会默认使用源码模式。"></textarea>
<div id="markdownPreview" class="markdown-preview" hidden><p class="muted">点击“预览”查看当前正文。</p></div>
</div>
<label class="check"><input id="draft" type="checkbox" checked> 草稿箱状态（勾选后保存为草稿；取消勾选可保存已发布文章）</label>
<div class="actions"><button class="btn" type="button" id="checkGitHub">检查 GitHub 写入权限</button><button class="btn" type="submit" id="saveDraft" value="save">保存草稿</button><button class="btn primary" type="submit" id="publish" value="publish">发布文章</button><button class="btn danger" type="button" id="delete" disabled title="请先从左侧选择一篇已有文章">删除文章</button><button class="btn" type="button" id="reset">清空表单</button></div>
</form><div class="status" id="status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div><p class="muted">保存草稿会将文章写入 GitHub 并触发构建，但保持草稿状态；发布文章会将 draft 设为 false，提交到 GitHub，并跟踪 Cloudflare 部署结果。</p><a id="deployLink" class="deploy-link" href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" hidden>查看 Cloudflare 部署日志 ↗</a></section>
</div>
<section id="appearanceTabPanel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tabAppearance" class="settings-panel min-w-0" hidden>
  <div class="mb-1 text-base font-semibold text-gray-800">全局外观配置</div>
  <p class="mb-5 text-sm leading-6 text-gray-500">
    配置统一保存在仓库的 <code class="rounded bg-gray-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs">src/data/settings.json</code>。
    保存后会提交到 GitHub，并触发 Cloudflare 构建与部署；原有文章管理和登录保护保持不变。
  </p>
  <form id="settingsForm" class="settings-cards">
<section class="settings-card" aria-labelledby="appearanceBannerTitle">
      <div class="settings-card-heading"><span class="settings-card-number">01</span><div><h3 id="appearanceBannerTitle">全站背景与首页 Banner</h3><p>设置全站页面背景颜色/图片，以及首页顶部 Banner 的标题与副标题。</p></div></div>
<div class="settings-grid">
        <div class="settings-field" style="grid-column:1/-1">
          <label for="backgroundColor">全局背景颜色</label>
          <div class="settings-color-row">
            <input id="backgroundColorPicker" type="color" value="#f3f6f3" aria-label="选择全局背景颜色" class="settings-color-picker">
            <input id="backgroundColor" name="backgroundColor" type="text" maxlength="7" autocomplete="off" placeholder="留空使用主题默认颜色，例如 #f3f6f3" class="settings-control">
          </div>
          <small>支持 #RGB 或 #RRGGBB。选择颜色会自动填写色值；清空文本框后保存则恢复主题默认配色。</small>
        </div>
      </div>
<div class="settings-grid">
        <div class="settings-field"><label for="bannerTitle">主标题</label><input id="bannerTitle" name="bannerTitle" type="text" maxlength="200" placeholder="Lovely firefly!" class="settings-control"></div>
        <div class="settings-field"><label for="bannerSubtitle">副标题</label><input id="bannerSubtitle" name="bannerSubtitle" type="text" maxlength="500" placeholder="In Reddened Chrysalis, I Once Rest" class="settings-control"></div>
        <div class="settings-field" style="grid-column:1/-1">
          <label for="backgroundImage">背景图片链接</label>
          <input id="backgroundImage" name="backgroundImage" type="url" maxlength="2048" autocomplete="url" placeholder="https://example.com/background.jpg" class="settings-control">
          <div class="settings-preview" id="backgroundImagePreviewBox">
            <img id="backgroundImagePreview" alt="背景图片缩略预览" hidden>
            <span id="backgroundImagePreviewEmpty" class="settings-preview-note">填写 HTTP/HTTPS 图片链接后，可在此预览。</span>
            <span id="backgroundImagePreviewError" class="settings-preview-note" hidden>图片加载失败，请检查链接是否可公开访问。</span>
          </div>
          <small>清空时保留主题默认背景图。预览仅用于检查链接是否可访问。</small>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

<section class="settings-card" aria-labelledby="profileAnnouncementTitle">
      <div class="settings-card-heading"><span class="settings-card-number">02</span><div><h3 id="profileAnnouncementTitle">个人名片与公告</h3><p>配置头像、昵称、个人签名和侧栏多行公告。</p></div></div>
<div class="settings-grid">
        <div class="settings-field"><label for="avatar">头像链接</label><input id="avatar" name="avatar" type="url" maxlength="2048" placeholder="https://example.com/avatar.png" class="settings-control"></div>
        <div class="settings-field"><label for="nickname">昵称 / 用户名</label><input id="nickname" name="nickname" type="text" maxlength="120" placeholder="XiaYe" class="settings-control"></div>
        <div class="settings-field" style="grid-column:1/-1">
          <div class="settings-preview is-avatar" id="avatarPreviewBox">
            <img id="avatarPreview" alt="个人头像预览" hidden>
            <span id="avatarPreviewEmpty" class="settings-preview-note">填写头像链接后，可在此查看头像预览。</span>
            <span id="avatarPreviewError" class="settings-preview-note" hidden>头像加载失败，请确认图片链接可公开访问。</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="settings-field" style="grid-column:1/-1"><label for="bio">个人签名 / 简介</label><textarea id="bio" name="bio" rows="3" maxlength="5000" placeholder="Hello, I'm XiaYe." class="settings-control"></textarea><small>最多 5000 个字符。</small></div>
      </div>
