        <label class="settings-toggle"><input id="showNavAbout" name="showNavAbout" type="checkbox"><span class="settings-toggle-track" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="settings-toggle-label">显示“关于”菜单<small>控制打赏与关于我等菜单分组入口。</small></span></label>
