    <label class="settings-toggle"><input id="layoutGridCoverFullWidth" name="layoutGridCoverFullWidth" type="checkbox"><span class="settings-toggle-track" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="settings-toggle-label">网格封面贴边显示<small>开启后封面铺满卡片顶部；关闭则保留内边距。</small></span></label>
