      <div class="settings-field"><label for="aiProviderModel">模型 ID</label><input class="settings-control" id="aiProviderModel" maxlength="200" required placeholder="填写服务商提供的模型 ID"></div>
      <div class="settings-field"><label for="aiProviderKey">API Key（密码）</label><input class="settings-control" id="aiProviderKey" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" spellcheck="false" maxlength="2000" placeholder="新建时必填；已有配置留空表示不更换"><small id="aiProviderKeyHelp">密钥只会在提交时发送到本站服务端；保存后输入框会清空。</small></div>
